                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This is honestly one of the best games I’ve ever played. You probably think I'm crazy, huh? Sure, it's a lot simpler than your \"normal\" strategy game, but it's unique, engaging, and educational.\n\nThe aesthetics are perfect, the interface is intuitive, and the game is just plain charming as a whole. Every turn forces meaningful decisions. But the best part is the immersion - the map, the gameplay, and the art all pull you right in. The depth of historical detail is stunning. Highly recommend.",
